The channel logos in picons.zip are the broadcasters' marks, collected by the picons
contributors (https://github.com/picons/picons) under GPL-3.0-only; the license text is
packaging/picons-GPL-3.0.txt, the source https://github.com/picons/picons/releases.
They are a separate data file: nothing in the program links or embeds them, and the program
runs without them.
